# Harness Log — rule provenance & amendment history

Every shared rule in `harness.md` should exist because of a real incident in
this repo (or, when bootstrapping a new project from this template, a real
incident somewhere the harness's author has seen this exact failure mode
before). This file holds the dates, incidents, and amendment history so
`harness.md` itself stays lean. Relaxing or amending a rule requires a
dated entry here.

